# Experience 0 capture harness: per-capture manifest shards. Intermediate
# only — SCREENSHOT_INDEX.md and manifest.json are the committed artefacts.
docs/experience/audit/.manifest-shards/

# Experience 0 full screenshot corpus. Deliberately OUT of normal Git history:
# the account corpus alone is 33 MB and the remaining surfaces would triple it.
# manifest.json carries every row with its SHA-256, a representative set is
# committed under docs/experience/audit/screenshots/, and the complete corpus is
# packaged at Experience 0 close onto the orphan branch `audit-artifacts`
# (see docs/experience/audit/ARCHIVE.md). No Git LFS — the repository does not
# use it, and a temporary evidence corpus is not a reason to adopt it.
docs/experience/audit/corpus/

# Sabotage harness bytecode
tools/sabotage/__pycache__/
